g out] the threat.","j":26,"h":52,"s":50,"a":20,"sd":null},{"k":"50:21","t":"And every soul will come, with it a driver and a witness.","j":26,"h":52,"s":50,"a":21,"sd":null},{"k":"50:22","t":"[It will be said], \"You were certainly in unmindfulness of this, and We have removed from you your cover, so your sight, this Day, is sharp.\"","j":26,"h":52,"s":50,"a":22,"sd":null},{"k":"50:23","t":"And his companion, [the angel], will say, \"This [record] is what is with me, prepared.\"","j":26,"h":52,"s":50,"a":23,"sd":null},{"k":"50:24","t":"[Allāh will say], \"Throw into Hell every obstinate disbeliever,","j":26,"h":52,"s":50,"a":24,"sd":null},{"k":"50:25","t":"Preventer of good, aggressor, and doubter,","j":26,"h":52,"s":50,"a":25,"sd":null},{"k":"50:26","t":"Who made [as equal] with Allāh another deity; then throw him into the severe punishment.\"","j":26,"h":52,"s":50,"a":26,"sd":null},{"k":"50:27","t":"His [devil] companion will say, \"Our Lord, I did not make him transgress, but he [himself] was in extreme error.\"","j":26,"h":52,"s":50,"a":27,"sd":null},{"k":"50:28","t":"[Allāh] will say, \"Do not dispute before Me, while I had already presented to you the threat [i.e., warning].","j":26,"h":52,"s":50,"a":28,"sd":null},{"k":"50:29","t":"The word [i.e., decree] will not be changed with Me, and never will I be unjust to the servants.\"","j":26,"h":52,"s":50,"a":29,"sd":null},{"k":"50:30","t":"On the Day We will say to Hell, \"Have you been filled?\" and it will say, \"Are there some more,\"","j":26,"h":52,"s":50,"a":30,"sd":null},{"k":"50:31","t":"And Paradise will be brought near to the righteous, not far,","j":26,"h":52,"s":50,"a":31,"sd":null},{"k":"50:32","t":"[It will be said], \"This is what you were promised - for every returner [to Allāh] and keeper [of His covenant].","j":26,"h":52,"s":50,"a":32,"sd":null},{"k":"50:33","t":"Who feared the Most Merciful in the unseen and came with a heart returning [in repentance].","j":26,"h":52,"s":50,"a":33,"sd":null},{"k":"50:34","t":"Enter it in peace. This is the Day of Eternity.\"","j":26,"h":52,"s":50,"a":34,"sd":null},{"k":"50:35","t":"They will have whatever they wish therein, and with Us is more.","j":26,"h":52,"s":50,"a":35,"sd":null}],"juz":26,"hizb":52,"surahs":[50],"sajdah":false}